  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET MVC Buttons package provides a comprehensive suite of button controls including Button, ButtonGroup, DropDownButton, SplitButton, ProgressButton, Chips, Floating Action Button (FAB), and SpeedDial. These controls offer extensive customization options such as icons, RTL support, toggle behavior, accessibility compliance, and theme support. They are designed to deliver a consistent and interactive user interface across all modern browsers in ASP.NET MVC applications.",
